WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.298
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:00.398 --> 00:01.597
(All characters and organisations in this drama are fictional.)

3
00:01.597 --> 00:02.667
(Filming with minors followed broadcast guidelines,)

4
00:02.667 --> 00:03.359
(and generative AI was used in select scenes.)

5
00:06.237 --> 00:08.097
Gyu Rim might have eaten some...

6
00:09.207 --> 00:10.307
What if she ate them?

7
00:10.867 --> 00:11.877
What happens then?

8
00:13.437 --> 00:15.247
(456 Geumje-dong 4ga)

9
00:18.999 --> 00:20.029
Mu Jin.

10
00:21.769 --> 00:23.499
Did you eat the oysters...

11
00:24.439 --> 00:26.169
- Eat oysters? - Did you?

12
00:26.239 --> 00:27.309
What oysters are you talking about?

13
00:28.509 --> 00:29.739
Did I eat oysters?

14
00:32.479 --> 00:34.149
The ones the boss...

15
00:34.579 --> 00:36.519
The oysters ma'am brought over?

16
00:36.679 --> 00:38.249
I didn't eat them. I put them in the fridge.

17
00:38.319 --> 00:39.889
I was going to make oyster pancakes for the kids.

18
00:41.289 --> 00:42.289
Mu Jin.

19
00:43.689 --> 00:45.559
What is going on?

20
00:45.659 --> 00:47.329
Did you run all the way here without your car?

21
00:47.389 --> 00:49.899
Some jerk blocked my car in,

22
00:50.199 --> 00:51.899
- so I couldn't drive it. - Some jerk blocked...

23
00:52.069 --> 00:53.729
your car?

24
00:54.829 --> 00:56.769
You ran all the way from the restaurant?

25
00:56.999 --> 01:00.509
- Why didn't you just call me? - You didn't...

26
01:01.609 --> 01:04.239
- pick up. - I didn't pick up?

27
01:07.579 --> 01:09.579
Oh, I left my phone at the store.

28
01:12.849 --> 01:14.349
I am so sorry.

29
01:15.319 --> 01:18.359
Come on, get up. Let's go home and get you some water.

30
01:18.359 --> 01:19.959
Oh, dear.

31
01:22.429 --> 01:23.759
What happened to you?

32
01:23.829 --> 01:29.639
- Why did you stumble back there? - I had indigestion from lunch,

33
01:29.769 --> 01:31.269
so I felt a bit dizzy.

34
01:32.409 --> 01:36.739
- Did you take some medicine? - Yes, I did. I am fine now.

35
01:36.809 --> 01:41.049
Thank goodness. I thought you ate the oysters...

36
01:42.949 --> 01:45.289
I was terrified you got food poisoning.

37
01:50.319 --> 01:52.229
Was there something wrong with the oysters?

38
01:52.959 --> 01:54.259
No, it is nothing.

39
01:54.559 --> 01:55.929
As long as you didn't eat them, it is fine.

40
01:56.099 --> 01:57.999
Make sure you throw them out later.

41
01:59.469 --> 02:00.529
Just to tell me not to eat them,

42
02:00.599 --> 02:02.439
you ran all the way here in the middle of work.

43
02:02.899 --> 02:05.469
How can a man love me this much?

44
02:06.969 --> 02:09.239
I can't even give you a fraction of that in return.

45
02:09.309 --> 02:12.179
You have a lot of love to give to others.

46
02:13.079 --> 02:17.349
In this lifetime, just love me as much as you can,

47
02:17.649 --> 02:18.949
and whatever love you have left over,

48
02:19.619 --> 02:22.789
you can roll it over to me in our next life.

49
02:25.259 --> 02:27.589
Why aren't you answering? Stop laughing.

50
02:28.259 --> 02:29.559
Do you not want to see me in our next life?

51
02:29.899 --> 02:32.869
No, let's meet in the next life too.

52
02:33.969 --> 02:36.099
Be born as my son then, Mu Jin.

53
02:36.639 --> 02:39.639
That way, I won't receive love, only give it.

54
02:40.169 --> 02:42.439
I can just shower you with it like rain.

55
02:47.109 --> 02:49.079
What a relief.

56
02:49.419 --> 02:51.949
- Look at all this sweat. - What a relief.

57
02:52.249 --> 02:55.189
(Hee Na)

58
03:02.399 --> 03:03.559
The call cannot be connected,

59
03:03.629 --> 03:05.729
so you will be connected to voicemail.

60
03:12.469 --> 03:13.909
Seo Min Ju did this, no doubt.

61
03:16.309 --> 03:19.349
I know her online slang, the way she talks, and her tone.

62
03:19.449 --> 03:20.979
It is 100 percent Min Ju who posted it.

63
03:21.649 --> 03:23.349
Min Ju wouldn't stop bugging Yoon Gi and me,

64
03:23.419 --> 03:25.189
demanding to know where you were.

65
03:25.889 --> 03:28.349
She said it wasn't her, but her mom who was looking for you.

66
03:31.089 --> 03:32.359
Hey, by any chance...

67
03:33.889 --> 03:35.799
That older woman you once hit on...

68
03:37.799 --> 03:39.199
Could she be Min Ju's mom?

69
03:47.209 --> 03:49.079
Are you out of your mind?

70
03:50.109 --> 03:52.279
How does marrying a gigolo make any sense?

71
03:53.409 --> 03:54.979
He is not a gigolo.

72
03:55.479 --> 03:56.879
He is not a gigolo anymore.

73
03:58.179 --> 04:00.749
Why on earth are you being so pathetic?

74
04:02.189 --> 04:03.189
If a murderer says,

75
04:03.259 --> 04:04.389
"I am not killing anyone starting today,"

76
04:04.459 --> 04:05.889
"so I am innocent," does that make it okay?

77
04:05.959 --> 04:08.189
You said the principal called you in and warned you.

78
04:08.499 --> 04:10.529
He asked what you would do if rumours spread at school...

79
04:10.799 --> 04:12.769
or if the parents started protesting...

80
04:12.829 --> 04:15.769
and told you to decide your future before that, right?

81
04:16.239 --> 04:17.939
Either way, I cannot break up with Gyu Oh.

82
04:18.639 --> 04:19.969
We even took our wedding vows...

83
04:20.039 --> 04:21.609
in front of our grandparents' photos.

84
04:22.879 --> 04:25.709
So you do not care if you get fired?

85
04:26.109 --> 04:27.979
You do not care if you lose your livelihood?

86
04:28.049 --> 04:29.049
Because of one's husband's past job,

87
04:29.119 --> 04:30.419
is it okay to just fire someone?

88
04:30.549 --> 04:32.119
Is it okay to cut off someone's livelihood?

89
04:32.549 --> 04:35.659
Guilt by association was abolished. Is that allowed in a democracy?

90
04:37.089 --> 04:40.089
Are you selling cabbages? Or baking street pastries?

91
04:40.629 --> 04:44.329
You are a teacher educating young kids, you idiot.

92
04:44.629 --> 04:47.599
Do you not know how conservative, moralistic, and terrifying...

93
04:47.799 --> 04:49.339
the education community is?

94
04:49.399 --> 04:53.469
If I get fired, I can sell cabbages. I can make a living baking pastries.

95
04:53.639 --> 04:54.909
You are seriously...

96
04:55.409 --> 04:57.609
If people were not watching, I would really smack you right now.

97
04:59.649 --> 05:01.409
Then what about your parents?

98
05:02.149 --> 05:05.519
What about Hee Seop? What about your family...

99
05:05.589 --> 05:07.249
who depends on your salary to survive?

100
05:11.259 --> 05:12.289
(Geumje-dong teacher Kwon cohabiting with a former host-bar gigolo?)

101
05:12.359 --> 05:13.629
The gigolo cohabiting with Teacher Kwon...

102
05:13.689 --> 05:15.629
from an elementary school in Geumje-dong...

103
05:16.029 --> 05:18.359
with the intention of marriage...

104
05:18.969 --> 05:20.199
Is this Gyu Oh?

105
05:23.239 --> 05:25.169
Gyu Oh is not a gigolo anymore, right?

106
05:25.239 --> 05:26.239
And cohabiting? What nonsense.

107
05:26.309 --> 05:28.009
He sleeps in this room with you every single night.

108
05:28.839 --> 05:30.079
What is going to happen to him?

109
05:34.609 --> 05:37.649
(Where are you, Han Gyu Oh? An old lady was looking for you.)

110
05:37.819 --> 05:39.989
Gyu Oh's name is in the comments here.

111
05:40.619 --> 05:42.889
"I saw a romantic dispute between a young woman..."

112
05:42.959 --> 05:45.459
"and an older woman."

113
05:47.089 --> 05:49.899
"I heard the gigolo's name is Han Gyu Oh."

114
05:51.759 --> 05:54.969
"Where are you, Han Gyu Oh? An old lady was looking for you."

115
05:55.029 --> 05:56.269
"Come out, Han Gyu Oh."

116
05:56.699 --> 05:58.539
This is driving me crazy.

117
05:59.369 --> 06:00.409
Could it be...

118
06:00.809 --> 06:03.509
No, Gyu Seo. It cannot be our brother.

119
06:03.939 --> 06:05.909
There are so many people named Han Gyu Oh in the world.

120
06:05.979 --> 06:07.379
There are so many gigolos in the world...

121
06:09.379 --> 06:10.649
No...

122
06:11.649 --> 06:13.289
Could our brother really be the only gigolo...

123
06:13.349 --> 06:14.749
named Han Gyu Oh?

124
06:15.119 --> 06:17.419
People in that line of work almost always use fake names.

125
06:17.489 --> 06:18.989
You know, like in the movies, right?

126
06:19.529 --> 06:20.729
It is not him, right?

127
06:28.169 --> 06:29.169
What is going on?

128
06:30.139 --> 06:31.269
Is he crying?

129
06:32.369 --> 06:33.639
I am not crying.

130
06:34.339 --> 06:35.809
Does he cry all the time?

131
06:36.539 --> 06:37.679
Let me see.

132
06:39.979 --> 06:42.349
- Tickle, tickle. - Dad.

133
06:42.919 --> 06:46.319
See? You were crying. Right? A grown man...

134
06:46.389 --> 06:47.389
crying at the drop of a hat...

135
06:47.449 --> 06:48.489
Why are you always in tears?

136
06:48.549 --> 06:50.789
- Are you depressed? - I told you, I am not crying.

137
06:50.859 --> 06:53.129
Then what is this, this, this? Is it rainwater?

138
06:57.999 --> 07:00.299
- It is because of Gyu Oh. - Han Gyu Min.

139
07:00.369 --> 07:02.599
Dad deserves to know. It is about his kid.

140
07:03.499 --> 07:04.939
He is heartbroken and upset...

141
07:05.839 --> 07:08.369
because of Gyu Oh. That is why Gyu Seo is like this.

142
07:09.539 --> 07:13.279
Wait, what about Gyu Oh?

143
07:13.749 --> 07:15.979
Our eldest son runs his own clothing store...

144
07:16.079 --> 07:18.619
- and is doing just fine. - Exactly...

145
07:19.519 --> 07:21.789
He was just starting to do well.

146
07:22.419 --> 07:25.729
He was just trying to get his life on track.

147
07:27.159 --> 07:30.229
He was doing fine, so why?

148
07:30.299 --> 07:31.899
Who did what to him?

149
07:32.099 --> 07:35.469
Did someone sabotage his future?

150
07:36.499 --> 07:40.039
- Forget it. Just stay out of it. - How can I?

151
07:40.109 --> 07:41.569
Gyu Rim must never find out.

152
07:42.209 --> 07:43.879
Gyu Rim can never know about this.

153
07:44.809 --> 07:46.809
Gyu Rim? She cannot know?

154
07:50.219 --> 07:53.249
Gyeol went to bed early today. Did he eat before going to sleep?

155
07:58.159 --> 07:59.489
Did something happen?

156
08:04.599 --> 08:05.829
What is going on?

157
08:07.769 --> 08:08.769
I have no idea.

158
08:09.869 --> 08:13.439
It seems like Gyu Oh has run into some kind of trouble,

159
08:13.809 --> 08:16.109
but the twins are crying and making a fuss together...

160
08:16.279 --> 08:18.849
and leaving me out, afraid I was going to tell you.

161
08:22.619 --> 08:25.319
What is it? What happened to Gyu Oh?

162
08:25.989 --> 08:27.649
Did something happen to him?

163
08:28.619 --> 08:30.219
What did Dad say to you?

164
08:31.989 --> 08:35.829
What happened to Gyu Oh? Just what on earth happened...

165
08:35.899 --> 08:38.259
that you are trying to keep it from me?

166
08:39.629 --> 08:42.199
Let us just tell her. It is about Gyeol's teacher,

167
08:42.269 --> 08:43.799
so she will find out eventually anyway.

168
08:44.899 --> 08:47.309
Gyeol's homeroom teacher? Ms. Kwon?

169
08:47.869 --> 08:48.879
What about her?

170
08:49.409 --> 08:51.139
Did something happen to Ms. Kwon?

171
08:58.049 --> 09:00.519
Gyu Seo. Gyu Min.

172
09:03.659 --> 09:04.919
I am not a stranger.

173
09:05.459 --> 09:08.799
I am Gyu Oh's sister, and I am your family.

174
09:18.269 --> 09:19.439
If you ever hear...

175
09:19.909 --> 09:22.339
any strange rumours about Gyu Oh,

176
09:22.409 --> 09:24.479
please do not misunderstand or be disappointed in him.

177
09:24.679 --> 09:26.179
Gyu Oh is ten thousand times...

178
09:26.249 --> 09:29.349
softer-hearted and more conscientious than Gyu Seo...

179
09:29.349 --> 09:31.079
Gyu Min, if you talk like that,

180
09:31.149 --> 09:34.489
I cannot understand you. I am not that smart,

181
09:34.549 --> 09:36.259
so I really do not get it.

182
09:37.259 --> 09:38.489
Please explain it more simply.

183
09:42.929 --> 09:46.399
Gyu Oh was dating Gyeol's homeroom teacher,

184
09:47.429 --> 09:49.969
and whether they got married or are planning to,

185
09:50.299 --> 09:51.739
I do not really know.

186
09:52.139 --> 09:54.769
Then someone doxxed Gyu Oh all over the internet,

187
09:55.039 --> 09:57.009
targeted him, maliciously framed him,

188
09:57.809 --> 09:59.179
and falsely accused him...

189
10:02.649 --> 10:04.019
What identity of Gyu Oh's?

190
10:06.389 --> 10:07.789
What about his identity?

191
10:10.289 --> 10:12.889
What on earth has our Gyu Oh been doing with his life?

192
10:21.499 --> 10:22.499
Han Gyu Oh?

193
10:24.469 --> 10:25.639
What brings you here?

194
10:34.949 --> 10:37.619
What is it? Did something happen?

195
10:44.419 --> 10:45.489
I came because I was scared.

196
10:50.129 --> 10:51.559
I felt like I would do something reckless.

197
10:53.829 --> 10:55.299
Afraid I might actually kill someone.

198
10:58.269 --> 10:59.369
That is why I came.

199
11:01.439 --> 11:02.479
So?

200
11:04.879 --> 11:06.479
Did you come here...

201
11:08.079 --> 11:09.079
so I would stop you?

202
11:25.429 --> 11:27.999
I should have just jumped and ended it all back then.

203
11:29.139 --> 11:30.339
Whether gigolo or crow,

204
11:30.839 --> 11:32.409
I would not have had to see this total disgrace.

205
11:33.809 --> 11:36.409
Right then and there, I should have just jumped.

206
11:37.709 --> 11:39.309
Gyu Seo, Gyu Min,

207
11:40.409 --> 11:41.809
and even you knew, Father.

208
11:43.749 --> 11:45.849
I was the only one kept in the dark.

209
11:48.719 --> 11:50.889
The kids banded together,

210
11:52.559 --> 11:54.459
swearing you must never find out.

211
11:58.429 --> 12:00.269
Ignorance is bliss.

212
12:03.069 --> 12:04.899
The kids spared you the bitter pill.

213
12:06.509 --> 12:07.769
And dumped all the crap on me.

214
12:38.569 --> 12:40.039
Gyu Rim probably knows everything now, right?

215
12:45.579 --> 12:46.779
It is all over now.

216
12:49.579 --> 12:50.819
I am finished.

217
12:54.689 --> 12:55.859
Does it all end...

218
12:57.689 --> 12:58.719
just because Gyu Rim finds out?

219
12:59.429 --> 13:00.729
She was the only one who couldn't find out.

220
13:02.659 --> 13:04.429
As long as she did not know, I could laugh, talk,

221
13:04.499 --> 13:06.099
act tough, act fine,

222
13:06.969 --> 13:08.499
pretend nothing was wrong,

223
13:09.939 --> 13:12.039
and live shamelessly as much as I wanted.

224
13:20.409 --> 13:21.449
Right.

225
13:22.779 --> 13:24.979
Well, if you had gotten away with it completely,

226
13:26.249 --> 13:27.949
that would have been ideal.

227
13:32.889 --> 13:34.159
She is your family, so what does it matter?

228
13:39.529 --> 13:40.999
Whether it is shameful,

229
13:42.469 --> 13:43.899
or humiliating,

230
13:45.399 --> 13:46.709
it is okay to show everything to her.

231
13:47.609 --> 13:48.639
Because you are family.

232
13:50.579 --> 13:51.679
Because she is your sister.

233
13:53.779 --> 13:55.179
Seeing her in pain and struggling...

234
13:56.019 --> 13:58.819
is going to hurt far worse than suffering on your own.

235
14:01.189 --> 14:02.249
Still, what can you do?

236
14:03.459 --> 14:04.659
That is what happens with family.

237
14:06.459 --> 14:07.789
Because you love each other that much,

238
14:08.789 --> 14:10.199
it hurts like crazy.

239
14:19.069 --> 14:23.109
And sure, those jerks threatening to expose you online...

240
14:24.209 --> 14:27.609
and saying they will crush your life are out of their minds.

241
14:30.749 --> 14:33.619
Still, you have to pay the price...

242
14:34.719 --> 14:36.219
for the path you chose.

243
14:39.589 --> 14:41.059
That is only fair.

244
14:46.299 --> 14:50.169
So there's no reason to blame anyone else.

245
14:54.769 --> 14:58.509
You've beat yourself up enough.

246
14:59.079 --> 15:00.109
Now, let's just adjust...

247
15:01.779 --> 15:03.179
our destination a little.

248
15:05.249 --> 15:06.419
Our original goal...

249
15:07.519 --> 15:09.359
was to keep Gyu Rim from getting hurt...

250
15:09.419 --> 15:10.559
or crying anymore, right?

251
15:11.459 --> 15:13.259
Well, she might still cry...

252
15:14.559 --> 15:15.659
or get hurt sometimes, but...

253
15:18.229 --> 15:19.869
Let's make sure she smiles...

254
15:21.029 --> 15:23.399
and stays twice as happy as she was hurt.

255
15:27.309 --> 15:29.179
That's our new destination.

256
15:29.979 --> 15:31.209
No more changes after this.

257
15:47.029 --> 15:48.489
A lot of things happened.

258
15:50.229 --> 15:52.029
It is too long to explain right now.

259
15:53.399 --> 15:56.439
I am dead tired right now, so tired I cannot say another word.

260
15:56.799 --> 15:58.739
Not today, but at your birthday party when you turn 100.

261
16:00.109 --> 16:01.209
Can I answer you then?

262
16:03.579 --> 16:05.979
Aren't you going to congratulate me?

263
16:08.479 --> 16:09.579
Right.

264
16:11.319 --> 16:13.789
Congratulations, Gyu Oh. I'm happy for you.

265
16:15.349 --> 16:17.559
You need to stand by Hee Na no matter what...

266
16:18.559 --> 16:20.729
and make her happy. Understood?

267
16:21.559 --> 16:24.259
That's why I'm getting married, of course.

268
16:45.819 --> 16:48.219
(Missed Call: Gyu Oh)

269
16:50.789 --> 16:51.989
(Seven Unread Messages From Gyu Oh)

270
16:52.659 --> 16:53.889
(Kwon Hee Na, I am worried. Please call me.)

271
16:53.959 --> 16:55.289
(If you do not want to hear my voice, send me a period.)

272
16:55.359 --> 16:56.799
(I'm worried sick, please...)

273
17:05.599 --> 17:07.569
(Mom)

274
17:23.089 --> 17:25.259
Mom, what are you talking about?

275
17:25.989 --> 17:27.059
What's wrong with him?

276
17:30.529 --> 17:31.729
Put him on the phone.

277
17:34.899 --> 17:37.869
Seriously, what is wrong with you?

278
17:42.439 --> 17:44.609
What do you mean, you're going to die?

279
17:48.509 --> 17:51.619
Why do you keep saying such pathetic things?

280
17:53.489 --> 17:54.549
Please.

281
17:56.019 --> 17:57.259
I'll get you treated.

282
17:58.659 --> 18:00.189
Whether it's in the US or wherever,

283
18:00.729 --> 18:01.829
even if I have to search the whole world,

284
18:01.889 --> 18:02.999
I will get you cured.

285
18:05.999 --> 18:06.999
Yes.

286
18:08.169 --> 18:09.439
I have plenty of money.

287
18:10.669 --> 18:12.569
I have lots of savings,

288
18:13.439 --> 18:15.109
and my salary went up, too.

289
18:15.969 --> 18:19.479
I'm loaded, so don't worry about money at all.

290
18:25.349 --> 18:27.789
Please.

291
18:32.089 --> 18:34.229
What is wrong with you?

292
18:45.499 --> 18:47.009
(If you do not want to hear my voice, send me a period.)

293
18:47.069 --> 18:48.709
(I'm worried sick, please...)

294
20:12.459 --> 20:15.289
Hope it doesn't hurt you too much, Gyu Rim.

295
20:19.729 --> 20:21.199
Even if it does, just a little.

296
20:24.169 --> 20:25.939
Only as much as you can bear.

297
20:30.379 --> 20:31.609
Please.

298
20:33.779 --> 20:35.609
Only as much as you can bear.

299
21:19.419 --> 21:20.429
Gyu Rim.

300
21:24.329 --> 21:26.029
I think Gyu Oh is back.

301
21:26.629 --> 21:29.799
I went to check just in case, and his shoes are in the entryway.

302
21:31.099 --> 21:32.099
Yes.

303
21:33.969 --> 21:35.609
You already knew.

304
21:39.779 --> 21:41.449
You didn't sleep at all, did you?

305
21:42.379 --> 21:44.419
I barely got three hours myself.

306
21:44.679 --> 21:46.349
Gyu Seo messaged me at 3:30am, too,

307
21:46.419 --> 21:47.889
saying he couldn't sleep.

308
21:51.219 --> 21:53.329
Dad's probably the only one who slept well.

309
21:53.559 --> 21:54.559
Just him.

310
22:12.909 --> 22:13.909
Gyu Oh.

311
22:16.679 --> 22:18.719
I know you're not sleeping, so why don't you get up?

312
22:20.349 --> 22:21.489
Isn't it stifling in there?

313
22:21.989 --> 22:24.119
How can you pretend to sleep for over an hour and a half?

314
22:28.589 --> 22:30.529
Sharp as a tack, you jerk.

315
22:35.029 --> 22:36.599
Were you with Ms. Kwon?

316
22:41.439 --> 22:42.469
Did you cry all night?

317
22:43.439 --> 22:44.779
Did I drop dead or something?

318
22:46.009 --> 22:47.279
No,

319
22:47.709 --> 22:49.549
my eye infection just flared up again. Why?

320
22:49.919 --> 22:51.849
I'm still very much alive and well,

321
22:52.349 --> 22:54.219
I'm not someone who crumbles over something like this,

322
22:54.689 --> 22:57.059
and this is certainly not something a grown man should blubber over.

323
22:58.389 --> 22:59.889
If anything,

324
23:01.259 --> 23:02.859
it just proves the world is fair.

325
23:03.729 --> 23:06.769
- What are you talking about? - Karma. You reap what you sow.

326
23:06.899 --> 23:10.099
It's justice. Come on, if someone commits a crime,

327
23:10.169 --> 23:11.769
they should be punished. Should they just get off scot-free?

328
23:12.239 --> 23:13.939
Do you think karma is that easy to cheat?

329
23:14.669 --> 23:15.669
Gyu Oh.

330
23:18.079 --> 23:19.079
I'm hungry.

331
23:19.139 --> 23:21.149
I'm going to make ramyeon. You want some, right?

332
23:23.179 --> 23:24.179
Come on out.

333
23:24.679 --> 23:27.919
Brooms, baseball bats, I put away everything I could find,

334
23:27.989 --> 23:30.659
so no matter what he says, please don't hit him, Gyu Rim.

335
23:30.989 --> 23:34.589
- I swear to you, Gyu Oh... - What about me?

336
23:38.559 --> 23:40.469
Never mind me,

337
23:42.729 --> 23:44.369
look at your face. What's going on here?

338
23:46.569 --> 23:48.239
You've got enough sleep in your eyes to blind someone.

339
23:50.709 --> 23:51.909
Is there any leftover rice, Gyu Rim?

340
23:52.539 --> 23:54.579
I want to put rice in my ramyeon.

341
23:55.849 --> 23:57.819
Let's see. Is there ramyeon?

342
23:59.179 --> 24:02.489
None? Did Dad already eat it all?

343
24:05.689 --> 24:07.159
We're going to have chicken ginseng soup.

344
24:07.989 --> 24:09.159
With real ginseng.

345
24:11.559 --> 24:14.099
There's exactly one abalone in the freezer,

346
24:14.169 --> 24:16.639
so whoever gets lucky might just find it in their bowl.

347
24:18.999 --> 24:22.069
Gather around, everyone. Who wants chicken ginseng soup?

348
24:24.539 --> 24:26.279
Does anyone want chicken ginseng soup?

349
24:26.609 --> 24:28.879
First come, first served. Just three people.

350
24:35.989 --> 24:38.489
Aren't you joining? She said first three people.

351
24:38.919 --> 24:39.929
What?

352
24:40.159 --> 24:42.789
You don't want any, Gyu Min? Don't you know...

353
24:42.959 --> 24:44.029
my chicken ginseng soup is to die for?

354
24:47.329 --> 24:49.969
I know. Of course I know.

355
24:50.899 --> 24:53.239
Count me in. First three people.

356
25:06.619 --> 25:10.359
My poor Gyu Oh...

357
25:14.129 --> 25:17.159
Just when it seemed like he was living a proper life...

358
25:20.129 --> 25:22.769
My poor eldest son. What will happen to him?

359
25:23.639 --> 25:27.609
This isn't the time for that, Dad. Get up. Come on, get up.

360
25:28.569 --> 25:30.309
- Get up. - But...

361
25:43.589 --> 25:45.289
Are you only making three servings?

362
25:45.859 --> 25:48.229
You know our family goes crazy for chicken ginseng soup.

363
25:48.389 --> 25:49.589
Are you trying to start a war?

364
25:50.929 --> 25:51.929
Right?

365
25:52.129 --> 25:53.669
It feels like a war will break out, doesn't it?

366
25:55.029 --> 25:58.539
Then why don't you hurry and buy two more chickens?

367
25:59.299 --> 26:01.439
Sure. Got it.

368
26:27.729 --> 26:30.569
- Everyone is pretending? - Yes.

369
26:30.639 --> 26:34.039
Pretending nothing's wrong. Pretending nothing happened.

370
26:35.269 --> 26:36.939
Pretending everything has always been fine.

371
26:37.539 --> 26:38.539
Why?

372
26:38.709 --> 26:41.109
Because they don't want to face the pain.

373
26:41.179 --> 26:43.249
So they overcompensate and change the subject...

374
26:43.319 --> 26:45.249
to avoid talking about it.

375
26:45.649 --> 26:47.719
- Why? - "Why?"

376
26:48.749 --> 26:49.889
Then would you prefer...

377
26:49.959 --> 26:52.119
Gyu Oh scowling because he's miserable...

378
26:52.189 --> 26:53.889
and refusing to look at the family,

379
26:54.129 --> 26:55.759
while Gyu Rim makes sure everyone knows...

380
26:55.829 --> 26:57.299
how hard she has it, crying her eyes out...

381
26:57.359 --> 26:59.869
like you do? When they're grown adults?

382
27:02.899 --> 27:04.669
Are you taking a dig at me right now?

383
27:05.669 --> 27:07.109
What I'm saying is,

384
27:07.169 --> 27:09.069
you should act like an adult too, Dad.

385
27:09.139 --> 27:11.979
Stop wearing all your emotions on your sleeve like a child.

386
27:13.409 --> 27:17.619
Honestly, how a father like you raised Gyu Rim and Gyu Oh...

387
27:17.779 --> 27:20.319
is the biggest mystery and suspense of my life.

388
27:20.389 --> 27:23.019
Now that Gyu Seo's quiet, is it your turn?

389
27:23.119 --> 27:27.359
You kids keep picking on me, but Gyu Rim, Gyu Oh, you twins...

390
27:27.429 --> 27:30.529
do you really think even one of you is normal?

391
27:30.799 --> 27:32.999
Do you think at class reunions,

392
27:33.059 --> 27:34.469
there's even one of you I can brag about...

393
27:34.529 --> 27:35.799
like my friends brag about their kids?

394
27:36.939 --> 27:37.939
Unbelievable.

395
27:38.569 --> 27:42.039
Anyway, just read the room, okay?

396
27:42.139 --> 27:44.709
At least put on a bad acting performance, please.

397
27:45.979 --> 27:47.309
Hopeless.

398
27:58.689 --> 28:02.089
Some chickens were standing at a crosswalk,

399
28:03.229 --> 28:05.199
and the light turned green.

400
28:05.729 --> 28:07.569
What did the chicken...

401
28:08.569 --> 28:09.629
at the front say?

402
28:12.569 --> 28:14.109
Chicken run.

403
28:17.779 --> 28:19.079
Hey, isn't that funny?

404
28:20.209 --> 28:21.679
Come on, that's hilarious.

405
28:22.209 --> 28:24.819
Chicken run. Funny, right?

406
28:41.599 --> 28:42.799
A chicken was walking...

407
28:44.239 --> 28:45.869
down the street...

408
28:46.569 --> 28:47.769
and fell down.

409
28:49.539 --> 28:50.609
What did it say?

410
28:52.539 --> 28:53.609
Chicken thump.

411
28:59.049 --> 29:00.589
Hey, it's funny.

412
29:03.819 --> 29:06.829
If it's funny, just laugh. Don't hold back.

413
29:10.399 --> 29:12.629
Funny, right? Chicken thump.

414
29:14.769 --> 29:16.229
- Father. - Yes?

415
29:16.299 --> 29:19.599
The laundry I hung on the rooftop, I forgot about my underwear.

416
29:19.699 --> 29:20.709
Come up and help me bring it in.

417
29:20.769 --> 29:22.469
Right in the middle of eating chicken?

418
29:22.539 --> 29:24.179
Yes, you can eat when we get back. Come on.

419
29:24.239 --> 29:25.739
Hey, wait.

420
29:25.839 --> 29:27.849
Why do you care about underwear all of a sudden?

421
29:27.909 --> 29:29.549
If you don't have any, just wear Gyu Oh's.

422
29:29.609 --> 29:31.879
Why would I wear his?

423
29:31.949 --> 29:34.519
- Hey, my chicken leg. - Hurry, let's go.

424
29:35.649 --> 29:38.859
Mom, why is the mood at home so weird today?

425
29:41.929 --> 29:42.929
What is weird about it?

426
29:43.529 --> 29:44.699
It is not weird at all.

427
29:46.299 --> 29:48.069
Gyeol, have some soup too.

428
29:48.369 --> 29:49.369
Okay.

429
29:54.139 --> 29:55.509
Chicken run wasn't funny?

430
29:57.479 --> 29:58.909
Chicken thump wasn't funny? Seriously?

431
30:10.059 --> 30:12.289
- Just come outside. - Why, why?

432
30:12.359 --> 30:14.629
- I was enjoying my food. - It is not funny.

433
30:14.689 --> 30:16.159
What is so funny about that?

434
30:17.129 --> 30:19.159
You made him uncomfortable with cheesy dad jokes.

435
30:19.299 --> 30:20.799
Why are you acting like this?

436
30:21.969 --> 30:24.569
Well, you said that was what we had to do.

437
30:24.769 --> 30:26.639
You said I should go over the top...

438
30:26.909 --> 30:27.969
and make him laugh to distract him.

439
30:28.039 --> 30:29.739
Could you just stay still?

440
30:30.939 --> 30:32.539
Can't you just act like an adult...

441
30:32.679 --> 30:34.879
and watch over him calmly and reliably?

442
30:36.109 --> 30:37.649
Hey.

443
30:38.319 --> 30:39.919
If I cry, you nag at me for crying.

444
30:39.979 --> 30:41.519
If I joke around, you nag at me for that.

445
30:41.749 --> 30:43.819
What do you want me to do?

446
30:43.889 --> 30:45.819
Then just stay still and do nothing.

447
30:47.589 --> 30:48.889
Unbelievable.

448
31:20.459 --> 31:21.589
Chicken run.

449
31:22.329 --> 31:23.329
Chicken thump.

450
31:26.699 --> 31:27.899
I could cry.

451
31:28.469 --> 31:29.469
Seriously.

452
31:36.879 --> 31:39.539
(All For You)

453
31:41.749 --> 31:43.379
Do you have this in a larger size?

454
31:46.779 --> 31:48.249
Yes, we do.

455
31:51.759 --> 31:52.759
Han Gyu Oh.

456
31:53.929 --> 31:55.989
We have larger sizes, ma'am,

457
31:56.689 --> 31:59.559
but the one you are holding looks like it would fit you well.

458
31:59.629 --> 32:01.969
- Why don't you try it on first? - Should I?

459
32:02.099 --> 32:03.229
I will show you to the fitting room.

460
32:03.299 --> 32:04.299
Okay.

461
32:11.909 --> 32:13.749
What are you doing here? Why did you come in?

462
32:15.109 --> 32:16.349
To earn a living. Why else?

463
32:16.749 --> 32:17.919
No, that is not what I meant.

464
32:17.979 --> 32:19.479
I will sort through the boxes that arrived,

465
32:19.719 --> 32:21.019
so help the customer when she comes out.

466
32:22.919 --> 32:23.919
What about Hee Na?

467
32:24.519 --> 32:25.519
Did she reach out to you?

468
32:26.889 --> 32:27.889
Did you see her?

469
32:33.129 --> 32:34.829
Is this your first time being betrayed lately?

470
32:35.129 --> 32:36.129
Why are you acting...

471
32:36.629 --> 32:37.639
so shocked?

472
32:38.739 --> 32:40.739
Are you sure?

473
32:41.169 --> 32:42.169
I am sure.

474
32:42.969 --> 32:44.209
Just in case,

475
32:44.279 --> 32:45.739
I went all the way down to Geumyeong Bay.

476
32:46.809 --> 32:48.979
The moment I looked into Mr. Im's eyes,

477
32:49.909 --> 32:53.349
I knew right away. "This guy is hiding something."

478
32:54.049 --> 32:55.219
"This was no simple mistake."

479
32:57.759 --> 33:01.859
I sat with him all night, coaxing him and reasoning with him.

480
33:02.629 --> 33:04.959
I even threatened to bury him in this industry,

481
33:06.099 --> 33:07.169
and he finally spilled.

482
33:08.329 --> 33:10.129
He said Seo Yong Cheol called him...

483
33:10.969 --> 33:12.599
and lured him with a huge sum of money,

484
33:13.609 --> 33:14.869
so he lost his mind for a moment.

485
33:18.079 --> 33:19.179
Where is Yong Cheol now?

486
33:19.979 --> 33:21.949
He vanished. His phone is turned off.

487
33:27.249 --> 33:28.249
Who could it be?

488
33:30.149 --> 33:31.759
Who would go this far to hurt me?

489
33:32.759 --> 33:34.959
What grudge do they have against me?

490
33:35.189 --> 33:36.189
Me.

491
33:37.029 --> 33:39.999
- Come on, you're crazy. - You never know. It could be me.

492
33:40.969 --> 33:44.539
Given how relentless this is, there's a 99 percent chance...

493
33:44.599 --> 33:47.369
it's someone close with a direct stake.

494
33:48.469 --> 33:51.279
From now on, don't trust me or anyone else.

495
33:51.909 --> 33:52.909
Your family...

496
33:55.249 --> 33:56.349
Trust only your own blood.

497
34:21.039 --> 34:22.939
- Jung Woo. - Yes?

498
34:24.939 --> 34:26.579
If by chance...

499
34:27.849 --> 34:28.849
you find out who is behind this...

500
34:28.909 --> 34:31.149
Then we punish them to the fullest extent of the law.

501
34:31.719 --> 34:32.879
Don't tell me.

502
34:33.219 --> 34:34.219
Why?

503
34:34.319 --> 34:35.989
Afraid you will go shoot them yourself?

504
34:36.149 --> 34:37.219
Keep it to yourself...

505
34:38.589 --> 34:39.659
and don't tell me.

506
34:40.389 --> 34:41.389
What are you talking about?

507
34:43.029 --> 34:44.029
Never mind.

508
34:46.799 --> 34:47.799
Let us just stop here.

509
34:48.499 --> 34:49.499
Don't dig any deeper.

510
34:50.129 --> 34:52.139
Are you insane? You forgot everything?

511
34:52.599 --> 34:53.809
Back in the old days,

512
34:53.869 --> 34:55.469
this would be worth drawing and quartering.

513
35:00.849 --> 35:03.279
Mom left for work. Come out and eat.

514
35:10.519 --> 35:11.659
Why are you staring like that?

515
35:12.289 --> 35:13.459
You'll burn a hole through my face.

516
35:15.389 --> 35:16.659
I am just not used to this.

517
35:19.829 --> 35:22.529
Well, the world is full of all kinds of people...

518
35:22.599 --> 35:23.869
and stories.

519
35:24.539 --> 35:25.539
Just eat your food.

520
35:25.739 --> 35:28.669
My mother worked hard to make dishes that are supposed to be brain food.

521
35:31.879 --> 35:33.179
Why live a double life?

522
35:33.679 --> 35:36.179
You're not a spy, so why deceive Grandmother Su Nam?

523
35:37.179 --> 35:39.979
If she knew her son was such a famous photographer,

524
35:40.219 --> 35:42.449
Grandmother Su Nam would be thrilled.

525
35:44.189 --> 35:48.329
She wouldn't faint from joy. Just hearing the word "camera"...

526
35:48.559 --> 35:49.959
would give her a heart attack from shock.

527
35:50.459 --> 35:51.459
Why?

528
35:52.099 --> 35:53.499
Isn't being a photographer...

529
35:53.629 --> 35:54.929
a thousand times better than being jobless?

530
35:55.699 --> 35:58.339
My father...

531
35:58.839 --> 36:00.299
was a photographer.

532
36:01.539 --> 36:04.179
He tried to shoot an orchid on a cliff...

533
36:04.309 --> 36:05.909
and lost his footing.

534
36:09.109 --> 36:10.109
No way.

535
36:10.949 --> 36:14.589
He died falling off a cliff while taking photos?

536
36:18.419 --> 36:20.359
So if she sees me holding a camera,

537
36:21.159 --> 36:24.359
she smashes it right on the spot and won't let me go near one.

538
36:26.429 --> 36:29.669
I didn't know that backstory.

539
36:31.469 --> 36:35.039
I think I get it now. You still want to take photos,

540
36:35.209 --> 36:36.409
and DNA doesn't lie.

541
36:40.949 --> 36:42.149
Still, you...

542
36:42.479 --> 36:45.079
How come you understand other families' feelings so well,

543
36:45.719 --> 36:47.949
yet when it comes to your own, you don't get them at all?

544
36:48.489 --> 36:50.619
Did you call Gyu Seo to ask if he's okay?

545
36:52.089 --> 36:54.129
He's probably fine, with his cast-iron stomach.

546
36:55.689 --> 36:57.499
He's not a kid. Why do I need to check in on him?

547
36:58.799 --> 37:02.069
Gyu Seo told me not to tell you, so I wasn't going to.

548
37:02.969 --> 37:06.039
Even if his eardrum didn't burst,

549
37:06.699 --> 37:08.869
they say his hearing will have issues going forward.

550
37:09.609 --> 37:12.279
Both Gyu Seo and Gyu Rim...

551
37:12.339 --> 37:13.979
No matter what you do,

552
37:14.049 --> 37:17.219
only your family will stick by your side to the very end.

553
37:17.219 --> 37:20.349
You immature brat, without even a sesame seed's worth of sense.

554
37:20.749 --> 37:21.749
Seriously.

555
37:22.089 --> 37:23.349
Are you giving a principal's lecture?

556
37:23.749 --> 37:25.619
Why do you nag so much?

557
37:26.119 --> 37:27.489
Just let me eat, please.

558
37:27.929 --> 37:28.929
Eat, then.

559
38:11.799 --> 38:15.469
(Gyeol's Teacher)

560
38:20.779 --> 38:23.509
(Gyeol's Teacher)

561
38:29.119 --> 38:31.989
Hello, Ms. Kwon. I'm Gyeol's mom...

562
38:32.719 --> 38:34.289
Han Gyu Oh's older sister.

563
38:35.089 --> 38:38.399
When you have some free time, could I see you briefly?

564
38:49.769 --> 38:51.439
What's taking you so long to decide?

565
38:52.139 --> 38:55.079
Radish kimchi is radish kimchi, and steamed eggs are steamed eggs.

566
38:55.709 --> 38:58.149
Hesitating like that...

567
38:58.219 --> 38:59.519
isn't going to make food that's already cooked...

568
38:59.579 --> 39:00.589
taste any better.

569
39:03.719 --> 39:05.019
When will the owner be back?

570
39:09.259 --> 39:10.389
How should I know?

571
39:11.329 --> 39:13.999
She might have gotten sidetracked during a delivery.

572
39:15.169 --> 39:18.439
Did you come to buy side dishes, or did you come to see the owner?

573
39:18.539 --> 39:21.239
Our boss already has a man, you know.

574
39:24.809 --> 39:28.209
- I'm back. - Oh, the boss is here.

575
39:37.019 --> 39:38.419
What brings you here?

576
39:38.719 --> 39:40.359
I was worried and wanted to see if you were okay.

577
39:42.429 --> 39:44.529
I texted you a week ago.

578
39:44.859 --> 39:46.159
I went straight to the hospital to get checked...

579
39:46.229 --> 39:48.429
and told you I was fine, so not to worry.

580
39:50.229 --> 39:51.239
Anyway,

581
39:51.839 --> 39:53.639
how did you know this was my store?

582
39:54.139 --> 39:56.069
An acquaintance of mine is a regular here.

583
39:57.039 --> 39:59.679
The name happened to match yours,

584
40:00.609 --> 40:01.679
so I thought it was fascinating.

585
40:02.249 --> 40:03.249
Hold on a second.

586
40:05.349 --> 40:06.819
Say "side dishes"!

587
40:10.519 --> 40:11.859
What do you think you're doing right now?

588
40:12.019 --> 40:14.959
I was going to send it to my friend. To show I visited this shop, too.

589
40:16.529 --> 40:18.729
I'm sorry, but please delete that right now. Immediately.

590
40:19.059 --> 40:20.259
Sure, no problem.

591
40:21.169 --> 40:22.169
I'll delete it right away.

592
40:22.229 --> 40:23.869
(Suragan Side Dishes)

593
40:26.099 --> 40:27.099
Excuse me.

594
40:33.839 --> 40:35.909
I knew he was weird from the start.

595
40:36.209 --> 40:38.319
He dawdled around without buying any side dishes.

596
40:38.649 --> 40:39.649
Do you know him?

597
40:51.599 --> 40:53.599
(Han Gyu Rim)

598
40:59.999 --> 41:03.669
(Gyu Young)

599
41:04.339 --> 41:05.909
Your sister is Han Gyu Rim, right?

600
41:06.579 --> 41:08.249
If you don't want your family getting hurt,

601
41:08.749 --> 41:10.279
come out right now, Han Gyu Young.

602
41:11.919 --> 41:13.849
That psycho bastard, seriously.

603
41:19.089 --> 41:21.689
What should we do? Should I call the police?

604
41:24.559 --> 41:26.259
No, send them in.

605
41:29.499 --> 41:30.499
Come in.

606
41:34.409 --> 41:36.009
Yes, you may go back to work.

607
41:37.709 --> 41:39.179
(Chairman Jang Hoon Tae)

608
41:49.549 --> 41:51.189
What is going on here now?

609
41:51.919 --> 41:56.089
We are so sorry. We were very thoughtless.

610
41:57.899 --> 42:01.199
I was out of line and ran my big mouth, Chairman Jang.

611
42:01.629 --> 42:03.669
I deeply, deeply regret it.

612
42:05.169 --> 42:06.839
Pretend we never asked for ten million dollars,

613
42:06.939 --> 42:08.909
and just give us the five million dollars...

614
42:08.969 --> 42:11.179
- as originally agreed... - I told you before.

615
42:12.139 --> 42:14.609
Not a single penny.

616
42:14.879 --> 42:15.879
I was wrong.

617
42:17.179 --> 42:18.919
I spoke way out of turn.

618
42:19.319 --> 42:20.519
We are sorry.

619
42:21.089 --> 42:23.289
We must have lost our minds.

620
42:23.689 --> 42:24.759
What should we do about that, though?

621
42:25.659 --> 42:27.529
Once I make up my mind,

622
42:27.589 --> 42:29.329
I am not the type to change it easily.

623
42:30.689 --> 42:31.699
Right.

624
42:32.429 --> 42:34.059
If you are done talking, please leave.

625
42:34.499 --> 42:36.469
Even a glass of water is too good for you,

626
42:36.769 --> 42:38.999
so get out. And...

627
42:40.469 --> 42:42.669
stop barging into my company like this.

628
42:42.769 --> 42:44.009
If you have an issue,

629
42:45.009 --> 42:47.239
go through my lawyer.

630
42:54.549 --> 42:57.989
About those lawyers, they are top-notch...

631
42:58.059 --> 43:00.489
and awfully expensive.

632
43:01.289 --> 43:04.429
Why pay such exorbitant fees to lawyers...

633
43:04.499 --> 43:08.929
over something like this? Just settle with us instead.

634
43:08.999 --> 43:11.039
We will give you a good deal.

635
43:11.169 --> 43:12.539
We do not even need five million dollars.

636
43:12.599 --> 43:15.869
Cut it in half. Just give us 2.5 million dollars.

637
43:16.339 --> 43:17.639
You know that getting lawyers involved...

638
43:17.709 --> 43:19.379
will only stir up rumours, right?

639
43:19.709 --> 43:21.379
Nowadays, rumours are far more terrifying...

640
43:21.509 --> 43:23.249
than the truth.

641
43:24.109 --> 43:26.219
Are you going to let Gyu Young's life be ruined?

642
43:27.149 --> 43:29.949
Setting Gyu Young aside, think of yourself, Chairman Jang.

643
43:30.449 --> 43:32.319
Above all, should you let your reputation...

644
43:32.489 --> 43:35.529
be tarnished? No, of course not.

645
43:35.589 --> 43:37.729
You are known as the paragon of business...

646
43:37.799 --> 43:42.529
and widely respected. Think of your dignity and prestige.

647
43:42.599 --> 43:46.569
I have no dignity or prestige that is worth saving...

648
43:46.639 --> 43:48.309
by colluding with people like you.

649
43:49.169 --> 43:50.309
Even if I did,

650
43:50.609 --> 43:53.739
what does it matter if it gets scuffed or bruised?

651
43:54.139 --> 43:55.549
It is not like I can take it to the grave.

652
43:56.409 --> 43:57.409
Listen to me.

653
43:59.279 --> 44:00.549
Do you still think this kind of blackmail...

654
44:00.619 --> 44:01.619
will work on me?

655
44:03.619 --> 44:04.619
Listen carefully.

656
44:05.619 --> 44:07.629
My lawyer probably told you already,

657
44:08.489 --> 44:11.899
but I was the one who orchestrated this marriage.

658
44:13.059 --> 44:14.059
Yes.

659
44:14.669 --> 44:17.869
Without realising you people were a pack of worthless scammers,

660
44:17.939 --> 44:21.869
I got greedy and tried to set up my daughter...

661
44:21.869 --> 44:23.009
with a good marriage,

662
44:23.609 --> 44:25.739
and I took things too far. Yes.

663
44:26.779 --> 44:29.779
If I have to pay the price for that, I will pay it.

664
44:30.009 --> 44:31.019
However,

665
44:31.919 --> 44:32.949
from this moment on,

666
44:33.919 --> 44:37.019
if Gyu Young's name ever crosses your lips again,

667
44:37.089 --> 44:39.359
I will put my fortune,

668
44:39.959 --> 44:41.759
everything I have, on the line...

669
44:42.659 --> 44:45.559
to make you pay dearly, all the way to the bitter end.

670
44:46.429 --> 44:48.069
- Chairman Jang. - Chairman Jang.

671
44:48.769 --> 44:50.429
That is all I have to say. Yes.

672
44:50.939 --> 44:51.939
Chairman Jang.

673
44:54.809 --> 44:56.469
As a parent raising a child myself,

674
44:56.539 --> 44:58.279
there is something I am genuinely curious about.

675
44:59.009 --> 45:00.479
I can write off your son,

676
45:01.009 --> 45:02.849
since this is all he has ever seen and learned...

677
45:02.909 --> 45:03.909
his entire life.

678
45:05.279 --> 45:06.279
But you are his parents.

679
45:07.279 --> 45:08.749
How can parents gamble their son's life...

680
45:09.319 --> 45:11.989
on such an absurd fraud scheme?

681
45:12.059 --> 45:13.919
How is that even possible?

682
45:14.489 --> 45:16.929
Even if you were so blinded by money that you could not see straight,

683
45:17.029 --> 45:18.429
you are still his parents.

684
45:20.259 --> 45:21.899
Even wild beasts risk their own lives...

685
45:21.999 --> 45:23.029
to protect their young,

686
45:23.969 --> 45:25.199
yet you are supposed to be human.

687
45:27.499 --> 45:28.509
If you are human,

688
45:29.169 --> 45:31.409
you would tear out your own heart to protect your child...

689
45:31.539 --> 45:33.309
and want to make them happy...

690
45:33.579 --> 45:35.779
That is what it means to be a parent and a human being.

691
45:41.449 --> 45:42.649
I will see you at the police station.

692
45:44.049 --> 45:45.459
- Chairman Jang. - Chairman Jang.

693
45:45.559 --> 45:46.589
(Damga Charcoal Grill)

694
45:46.919 --> 45:49.059
Here you go. Enjoy your meal.

695
46:00.339 --> 46:01.339
You know,

696
46:02.209 --> 46:05.579
my daughter's face is prettier than any flower.

697
46:08.409 --> 46:10.409
Could you move the baby's breath...

698
46:11.349 --> 46:13.479
so I can see my Seo Hyun's face?

699
46:26.929 --> 46:31.269
(Damga Charcoal Grill)

700
46:42.879 --> 46:45.079
Congratulations on the grand opening, Mom.

701
46:47.819 --> 46:48.819
Thank you.

702
46:51.419 --> 46:52.819
Thank you, sweetheart.

703
47:00.499 --> 47:02.099
Eat slowly. You will get an upset stomach.

704
47:03.099 --> 47:04.269
The meat is so delicious.

705
47:11.809 --> 47:14.679
Is there something you want to tell me?

706
47:19.119 --> 47:20.519
I can tell there is.

707
47:25.489 --> 47:29.929
I am not going to take your food, so chew thoroughly, swallow it all,

708
47:30.059 --> 47:31.159
and eat slowly.

709
47:41.839 --> 47:42.839
My gosh.

710
47:43.939 --> 47:45.139
Oh, no.

711
47:46.109 --> 47:49.549
Once my Seo Hyun starts crying, she cannot stop.

712
47:52.349 --> 47:54.819
If you have something on your mind, tell me everything.

713
47:57.049 --> 47:59.089
Do not swallow it down with your food.

714
48:18.109 --> 48:19.439
Mom, I...

715
48:21.779 --> 48:23.409
I met Han Gyu Rim.

716
48:26.019 --> 48:27.849
Why is she so...

717
48:28.889 --> 48:33.719
mature, warm, and kind? It makes me feel so guilty.

718
48:37.259 --> 48:42.099
Did this happen because I cursed her and wished she wouldn't be happy?

719
48:44.369 --> 48:45.899
What do I do, Mom?

720
48:47.339 --> 48:49.939
I feel so terrible, what should I do?

721
48:51.839 --> 48:54.879
What on earth did I do to Han Gyu Rim?

722
49:02.149 --> 49:04.119
She said her baby died.

723
49:07.959 --> 49:09.259
Seven years ago,

724
49:09.889 --> 49:12.529
when she called, begging you to come...

725
49:12.929 --> 49:13.959
Back then...

726
49:15.029 --> 49:17.699
She said the baby she gave birth to died.

727
49:38.559 --> 49:40.219
- Ji Hye. - Yes, ma'am?

728
49:40.919 --> 49:43.389
- I will be out for a bit. - Yes, of course.

729
49:43.989 --> 49:46.999
(Suragan Side Dishes)

730
49:54.099 --> 49:56.909
(Suragan Side Dishes)

731
50:06.179 --> 50:07.179
What are you doing?

732
50:08.519 --> 50:09.549
Come here.

733
50:10.519 --> 50:11.659
Come over here.

734
50:13.219 --> 50:14.259
Hurry up.

735
50:19.499 --> 50:20.759
Leave Gyu Rim alone.

736
50:21.399 --> 50:23.729
She is already on the verge of losing it over Gyu Oh.

737
50:23.799 --> 50:25.039
If she sees you right now,

738
50:25.399 --> 50:28.739
our Gyu Rim will get so overwhelmed that she will completely snap.

739
50:32.539 --> 50:33.839
That Gyu Oh is a gigolo...

740
50:34.079 --> 50:36.479
No, that he used to be one...

741
50:38.649 --> 50:39.979
Gyu Rim found out.

742
50:41.689 --> 50:42.819
Gosh, hot.

743
50:45.189 --> 50:46.519
By the way, what did you come for?

744
50:48.059 --> 50:50.259
You dumped that lunchbox here and took off before.

745
50:52.629 --> 50:54.629
I should have taken them with me.

746
50:56.199 --> 50:59.139
- What? - Gyu Rim, Gyu Young, and Gyu Oh.

747
51:01.099 --> 51:03.109
I shouldn't have left them with you, Han Seok Joong.

748
51:04.069 --> 51:06.909
No matter what it took, I should have raised them myself.

749
51:08.249 --> 51:09.279
If I had,

750
51:10.279 --> 51:11.449
our Gyu Rim...

751
51:13.779 --> 51:15.789
She would have gone to college somehow.

752
51:17.649 --> 51:21.489
She wouldn't be looked down on and treated like dirt by others...

753
51:22.729 --> 51:24.389
like she is now.

754
51:25.059 --> 51:27.229
- Hey. - And our Gyu Oh...

755
51:27.699 --> 51:30.769
If I had raised him, he wouldn't have become a gigolo.

756
51:32.169 --> 51:33.999
If I had raised them,

757
51:34.069 --> 51:35.669
even if they weren't wildly successful,

758
51:36.869 --> 51:39.539
at least, like everyone else, they would have lived a normal life.

759
51:39.609 --> 51:42.909
Do you think kids just grow up the way parents want them to?

760
51:43.749 --> 51:45.879
Do you think I wanted to raise them like this?

761
51:46.849 --> 51:49.519
I had to raise kids without a mother...

762
51:49.589 --> 51:51.119
This is all because of you.

763
51:52.119 --> 51:54.889
You went crazy for another woman and kicked me out.

764
51:56.159 --> 51:57.659
So why am I the villain?

765
51:58.459 --> 52:00.459
You were the one in the wrong,

766
52:00.529 --> 52:02.869
so why was I torn away from my own children...

767
52:03.269 --> 52:05.169
and unable to see them, no matter how much I missed them?

768
52:06.899 --> 52:09.609
Why do I have to be the one who deserves to die?

769
52:09.669 --> 52:10.669
Why?

770
52:12.909 --> 52:14.109
Is this right?

771
52:14.879 --> 52:16.209
Is this how it should be?

772
52:17.279 --> 52:19.049
You are the piece of trash here,

773
52:19.649 --> 52:21.849
so why does it have to be so unfair? Why?

774
52:22.619 --> 52:25.659
Hey, when did I ever stop you from seeing them?

775
52:26.059 --> 52:28.689
You didn't even call once in 17 years.

776
52:29.229 --> 52:32.199
- You were the one who cut all ties. - Because I didn't know.

777
52:33.059 --> 52:34.999
That woman you claimed you couldn't live without...

778
52:35.069 --> 52:37.999
I had no idea she abandoned the kids and ran off.

779
52:39.439 --> 52:42.439
Since things turned out that way, I wanted them to forget me...

780
52:43.569 --> 52:46.039
and bond with their new mother.

781
52:47.009 --> 52:48.709
I thought I'd only confuse them.

782
52:49.379 --> 52:51.979
I was afraid of making things harder on them.

783
52:53.249 --> 52:54.249
Really?

784
52:55.549 --> 52:57.049
You had such deep intentions?

785
52:58.989 --> 53:02.189
I figured you remarried into wealth, started a new family,

786
53:02.359 --> 53:06.959
- and forgot all about your kids. - How could I forget?

787
53:07.729 --> 53:09.869
How could a mother ever forget her children?

788
53:17.269 --> 53:19.209
Then why did I do it?

789
53:20.979 --> 53:23.249
Why didn't I see Gyu Rim?

790
53:25.049 --> 53:27.179
She was looking for her mother so desperately.

791
53:27.249 --> 53:28.589
Why did I do that?

792
53:30.619 --> 53:31.989
Was I out of my mind?

793
53:32.559 --> 53:33.919
Am I even human?

794
53:36.329 --> 53:37.689
And to Gyu Young and Gyu Oh...

795
53:37.759 --> 53:39.459
I said things I didn't even mean.

796
53:40.159 --> 53:42.029
Why on earth did I do that?

797
53:43.829 --> 53:45.199
I must have lost my mind.

798
53:46.339 --> 53:50.209
I must be insane. I'm totally out of my mind.

799
53:57.509 --> 53:59.219
I'm really sorry for driving you crazy.

800
53:59.349 --> 54:01.789
I wasn't in my right mind back then either.

801
54:02.419 --> 54:04.919
I'm so sorry I drove you to madness too.

802
54:05.959 --> 54:09.429
Now that you're laying it all out point by point,

803
54:11.189 --> 54:14.829
I finally see just how terrible my sins are.

804
54:16.569 --> 54:17.769
Why did I do that?

805
54:18.499 --> 54:19.639
Am I even human?

806
54:42.959 --> 54:44.459
Please punish me.

807
54:46.929 --> 54:49.599
Punish me for abandoning my children.

808
54:52.139 --> 54:53.539
Please do.

809
54:55.509 --> 54:57.209
This is the model I mentioned last time.

810
54:57.639 --> 54:59.509
He has a great image, so the feedback is very positive.

811
55:00.839 --> 55:03.449
This is how the photo shoot turned out.

812
55:04.979 --> 55:06.579
Internal reviews are glowing as well.

813
55:07.479 --> 55:08.889
I did it.

814
55:10.049 --> 55:11.089
I wanted my son...

815
55:12.819 --> 55:13.959
Mu Jin...

816
55:14.459 --> 55:17.359
to lose absolutely everything.

817
55:17.359 --> 55:21.769
So I paid those people to do all of it.

818
55:22.429 --> 55:23.429
Why?

819
55:23.999 --> 55:24.999
You...

820
55:26.299 --> 55:30.269
To make you give up on him even one second faster.

821
55:30.869 --> 55:31.909
Oh my.

822
55:32.209 --> 55:33.209
Chairman Hong.

823
55:34.579 --> 55:35.579
What do I do?

824
55:36.149 --> 55:38.149
I just remembered.

825
55:39.179 --> 55:40.179
What do I do?

826
55:40.749 --> 55:43.449
I called Han Gyu Rim,

827
55:43.889 --> 55:46.489
got completely drunk, and confessed everything.

828
55:47.189 --> 55:48.459
What should I do?

829
55:49.589 --> 55:50.589
Wait, why?

830
55:51.189 --> 55:54.429
What am I going to do? That girl must have...

831
55:55.399 --> 55:58.799
tattled about everything by now. Mu Jin has probably...

832
55:58.869 --> 56:00.369
blown a gasket and collapsed in shock.

833
56:00.569 --> 56:03.569
He'll swear never to see his own mother again. What do I do?

834
56:03.869 --> 56:04.939
When you pulled that stunt,

835
56:05.009 --> 56:06.909
did you not consider that Mu Jin might cut ties with you?

836
56:06.979 --> 56:07.979
Honestly,

837
56:08.479 --> 56:11.209
how could a girl have such a big mouth?

838
56:11.579 --> 56:13.249
Tattling about every little thing,

839
56:13.319 --> 56:14.549
even drunken rambling...

840
56:14.619 --> 56:15.619
What is she trying to pull?

841
56:16.719 --> 56:19.359
Bringing a girl like that in as a daughter-in-law...

842
56:19.419 --> 56:22.189
means total war with the in-laws. You know that, right?

843
56:23.889 --> 56:25.429
Do not worry too much.

844
56:25.499 --> 56:27.529
I am sure she did not utter a single word to Mu Jin.

845
56:28.499 --> 56:31.069
Han Gyu Rim is much more considerate and mature than you think, Mom.

846
56:32.739 --> 56:34.869
What am I going to do? What do I do?

847
56:38.909 --> 56:40.909
(Chairman Hong Ok Seon)

848
56:42.179 --> 56:45.249
Chairman Hong cannot see anyone now...

849
56:45.249 --> 56:46.619
It is Jung Woo, Mother.

850
56:48.749 --> 56:49.749
Jung Woo?

851
56:54.659 --> 56:55.659
Oh my.

852
56:56.189 --> 56:58.459
It has been so long, Jung Woo.

853
57:00.629 --> 57:02.599
What brings you here?

854
57:05.799 --> 57:06.799
Sit down.

855
57:07.369 --> 57:08.509
Let us sit first.

856
57:46.509 --> 57:47.739
Hello.

857
58:20.279 --> 58:21.579
Please say something.

858
58:23.509 --> 58:24.679
Do you know that...

859
58:25.049 --> 58:27.319
you have not said a single word this whole time?

860
58:30.919 --> 58:32.459
You can curse at me...

861
58:33.689 --> 58:35.389
or blame me,

862
58:36.629 --> 58:38.159
so please, just say anything.

863
58:46.469 --> 58:47.699
I am sorry.

864
58:50.969 --> 58:53.339
Do not apologize. Curse at me instead.

865
58:53.839 --> 58:56.479
The one who should be apologising is me, not you.

866
59:05.289 --> 59:06.559
I am so sorry.

867
59:09.259 --> 59:11.589
I told the principal everything today.

868
59:12.399 --> 59:14.759
I told him that I do not know Han Gyu Oh...

869
59:15.869 --> 59:17.529
that I have never heard that name before.

870
59:22.339 --> 59:24.439
And that the person who came looking for me at school...

871
59:24.739 --> 59:26.839
mistook me for someone else,

872
59:27.509 --> 59:29.479
and that I will track down everyone who framed me online,

873
59:29.749 --> 59:32.679
who wrote malicious comments, and who made fake news shorts,

874
59:32.819 --> 59:34.419
and file criminal charges against all of them...

875
59:34.479 --> 59:35.819
with no leniency.

876
59:37.889 --> 59:38.959
So...

877
59:41.789 --> 59:42.929
Please help me.

878
59:46.899 --> 59:47.999
Please help me keep my job...

879
59:47.999 --> 59:50.199
so I can continue teaching at the school.

880
59:52.639 --> 59:53.839
Please help me not get fired,

881
59:54.639 --> 59:57.309
so I can earn money and support my family.

882
59:58.939 --> 01:00:00.209
Please help me.

883
01:00:06.019 --> 01:00:08.419
People are allowed to change their minds, are they not?

884
01:00:10.489 --> 01:00:12.589
After being reckless and infatuated,

885
01:00:13.559 --> 01:00:15.359
once reality hits,

886
01:00:17.259 --> 01:00:19.129
a person can come to their senses, right?

887
01:00:30.939 --> 01:00:32.109
Of course.

888
01:00:34.179 --> 01:00:35.379
That can happen.

889
01:00:37.009 --> 01:00:39.579
It happens all the time, Ms. Kwon.

890
01:00:41.849 --> 01:00:44.249
I did not come here to curse at you,

891
01:00:45.689 --> 01:00:47.719
nor did I come here to blame you.

892
01:00:49.789 --> 01:00:50.859
I just...

893
01:00:52.459 --> 01:00:53.799
I wanted to say thank you...

894
01:00:56.699 --> 01:01:00.199
Thank you so much for caring for our Gyu Oh...

895
01:01:01.739 --> 01:01:03.239
all this time...

896
01:01:06.239 --> 01:01:12.279
Please do not get sick, and make sure to eat well.

897
01:01:13.119 --> 01:01:14.979
I only came to tell you that.

898
01:01:20.359 --> 01:01:21.589
Thank you.

899
01:01:25.759 --> 01:01:26.959
For loving...

900
01:01:28.129 --> 01:01:29.729
our Gyu Oh,

901
01:01:31.599 --> 01:01:34.599
thank you so much, Ms. Kwon.

902
01:02:07.439 --> 01:02:08.669
Han Gyu Oh.

903
01:02:18.719 --> 01:02:20.219
Why are you out here?

904
01:02:22.389 --> 01:02:23.449
Just...

905
01:02:25.049 --> 01:02:26.319
The breeze is nice.

906
01:02:27.519 --> 01:02:28.829
Go on inside without me.

907
01:02:44.309 --> 01:02:46.879
Gyu Oh, if it hurts,

908
01:02:49.979 --> 01:02:51.409
then scream.

909
01:02:55.319 --> 01:02:57.219
Stop pretending you are fine.

910
01:02:59.459 --> 01:03:01.189
Stop pretending it does not hurt.

911
01:03:03.759 --> 01:03:05.189
Say it is killing you,

912
01:03:06.529 --> 01:03:07.929
beg for help,

913
01:03:10.169 --> 01:03:11.569
and scream.

914
01:03:15.299 --> 01:03:17.009
If it is hard, say it is hard.

915
01:03:18.879 --> 01:03:20.509
If you are lonely, say you are lonely.

916
01:03:21.439 --> 01:03:22.949
Just yell it out.

917
01:03:23.579 --> 01:03:24.709
Gyu Oh.

918
01:03:31.889 --> 01:03:33.289
It is so infuriating.

919
01:03:34.519 --> 01:03:36.159
It is driving me crazy.

920
01:03:38.259 --> 01:03:39.799
If not for you,

921
01:03:40.359 --> 01:03:42.329
I could have lived however I wanted.

922
01:03:43.999 --> 01:03:46.669
I could have broken the bones of everyone who crossed me,

923
01:03:46.969 --> 01:03:49.539
I could have killed everyone I wanted to,

924
01:03:50.669 --> 01:03:54.379
and even if I ended up in prison, I could have done what I wanted...

925
01:03:56.109 --> 01:03:58.309
and at least lived with peace of mind...

926
01:04:04.849 --> 01:04:06.889
It really pisses me off.

927
01:04:13.699 --> 01:04:16.829
Gyu Rim, can we just cut ties for good?

928
01:04:18.029 --> 01:04:20.499
Why can't we just live as strangers, like Gyu Young does?

929
01:04:21.569 --> 01:04:23.809
You are driving me insane.

930
01:04:23.909 --> 01:04:26.379
You are driving me completely crazy, you know?

931
01:04:34.779 --> 01:04:36.549
I am never cutting ties with you.

932
01:04:37.249 --> 01:04:39.689
No matter what crap you spout at me,

933
01:04:40.519 --> 01:04:41.789
I will never cut ties with you.

934
01:04:43.289 --> 01:04:45.329
Cutting ties with Gyu Young was enough.

935
01:04:47.929 --> 01:04:50.769
I will cling to your side like a leech...

936
01:04:51.129 --> 01:04:53.299
and drag you down by your legs.

937
01:04:54.339 --> 01:04:56.239
Even if you throw me in the trash,

938
01:04:56.409 --> 01:04:58.839
I will crawl right back out of that garbage can.

939
01:05:00.009 --> 01:05:03.049
Even if you lose your mind or go crazy,

940
01:05:03.649 --> 01:05:07.049
I will grab you by the collar and follow you until the day I die.

941
01:05:08.949 --> 01:05:10.289
Got that?

942
01:05:11.119 --> 01:05:12.419
You punk.

943
01:05:49.159 --> 01:05:50.859
(Love on the Menu)

944
01:05:50.959 --> 01:05:52.299
The bastard who made our mom like that...

945
01:05:52.359 --> 01:05:54.399
does not get to live happily ever after.

946
01:05:54.459 --> 01:05:56.029
"I thought it was love, but it was not."

947
01:05:56.029 --> 01:05:57.029
How dare you, girl?

948
01:05:57.029 --> 01:05:59.169
How dare you lay a hand on my precious child?

949
01:05:59.239 --> 01:06:01.299
Do you think I only did that for myself?

950
01:06:01.369 --> 01:06:03.739
What did they say the motive was for doing something so absurd?

951
01:06:03.809 --> 01:06:06.939
Have you seen anyone suspicious around the side dish shop?

952
01:06:06.939 --> 01:06:08.139
You know Han Gyu Young, right?

953
01:06:08.679 --> 01:06:12.479
That bastard is a total psycho, so run away right now, Han Gyu Rim!
